    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38012" root="لمظ" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْمَظُ</span></b>  A horse <i>having a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُمْظَة</span>, or <i>whiteness,
upon his lower lip:</i> when it is upon the upper lip.
he is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْثَمُ</span>: (S, K:) or a horse <i>whose
lower lip is white.</i> (Mgh.)

